# CHANGELOG

This file lists all the updates made to our Smart Grocery List and Budget Calculator project.

## Version v1.1.0 – August 28, 2026
- Added the Sort Items by Price feature.
- Items can now be arranged from highest to lowest price.
- Improved the menu and console formatting.
- Tested and fixed errors in the program.
- Integrated all features into the final version.

---

## Version v1.0.1 – August 28, 2026
- Added calculation of the total price for each grocery item.
- Added the Compute Total Cost feature.
- Improved the display of grocery information.
- Added basic input validation for price and quantity.

---

## Version v1.0.0 – August 28, 2026
- First version of the program.
- Created the basic program structure and main menu.
- Added the option to add grocery items.
- Added lists for storing item names, prices, and quantities.
- Added basic input and output functions.
